        <mxCell id="lgn2t" value="외부 구성요소" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#33465C;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2435" y="152" width="100" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bWeb" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FAEFF7;strokeColor=#A05195;strokeWidth=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="100" y="210" width="2440" height="240" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bWebh" value="웹 PC · Ubuntu 24.04 · Mosquitto + FastAPI + Spring Boot + PostgreSQL + React·Three.js (ROS 2 아님 · 범위 밖)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#A05195;strokeColor=#A05195;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#FFFFFF;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="100" y="210" width="2440" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bMain" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EFF1FB;strokeColor=#5566B5;strokeWidth=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="100" y="520" width="2440" height="1820" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bMainh" value="메인 PC (= 제어 PC) · Ubuntu 24.04 / ROS 2 Jazzy · 자체 노드 5개 + 제공 드라이버 · contact_scan_interfaces 정의 패키지(노드 아님)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#5566B5;strokeColor=#5566B5;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#FFFFFF;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="100" y="520" width="2440" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bRobot" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEF7F5;strokeColor=#2E8B7A;strokeWidth=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="100" y="2410" width="2440" height="260" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bRoboth" value="로봇 컨트롤러 · Doosan M0609 (DRCF · DART 2.12.1) · RG2 · 무센서 탐침 팁 · 배치 가이드/스토퍼 — 하드웨어 안전 담당" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2E8B7A;strokeColor=#2E8B7A;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#FFFFFF;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="100" y="2410" width="2440" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="WEBSTACK" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;[외부] 웹 스택 — FastAPI · Spring Boot · PostgreSQL · React+Three.js&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;브라우저/웹 PC · 명령 REST → FastAPI → MQTT · WebSocket 표시(mm) · 측정 DB 쓰기는 FastAPI · 업무·이력은 Spring · Broker 너머 한 덩어리로만 표시" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E9EDF1;strokeColor=#8A96A3;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#333F4E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="280" width="900" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="BROKER" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;[외부] MQTT Broker (Mosquitto)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;웹 PC · 단일 Broker · 중계만 하고 판단·저장 안 함 · 명령 retain=false · 토픽 19개 · JSON은 docs/contracts/mqtt-schema.md v0.1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E9EDF1;strokeColor=#8A96A3;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#333F4E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1450" y="280" width="750" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="MB" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;mqtt_bridge&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;ROS 2 ↔ MQTT 변환 · cmd/scan/+ → Action/Service 호출 · ROS Topic → MQTT JSON · cmd/ack(접수) ≠ 최종 결과(scan/command_result) · request_id 중복·만료 거절(&lt;b&gt;cmd/scan/stop은 만료 검사 제외&lt;/b&gt;) · m→mm · NaN→null · enum 문자열 · hb/web 실수신 시에만 /web/heartbeat · 표시용 다운샘플(10 Hz 설계 목표)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#4A5668&quot;&gt;param: broker_host · broker_port · client_id · topic_map_file · downsample_hz · hb_ros_hz · cmd_expiry_s · dedup_cache_size · topic_prefix · qos_default&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D3DCF5;strokeColor=#22357F;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=12;fontColor=#12294D;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="200" y="600" width="1400" height="180" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="SM" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;scan_manager&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;스캔 시퀀스 상태기계 · 재시작 · 형상 계산 · 로컬 원본 보관 — 시작 조건 → tare → DESCEND → 방향 루프(+x·−x·+y·−y) → &lt;b&gt;형상 생성(결과 즉시 발행) → 홈 복귀(마무리 · 정상 완료일 때만) → 완료&lt;/b&gt; / 중지·이상·실패(자동 복귀 없음) / 재시작 · &lt;b&gt;방향 전환 = MOVE_TO 연속(올림 → 원점 상공 → 접촉 z + 여유까지 저속 내림 · 재하강 없음)&lt;/b&gt; · SetConfig를 3개 노드로 전파 · scan_id·motion_id 발급 · /robot/sample 미구독(중단 위치 = ExecuteMotion Result pose)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#4A5668&quot;&gt;param: descend_speed_mps · slide_speed_mps · max_descend_m · max_slide_m · motion_timeout_s · lift_height_m · recontact_margin_m · recontact_speed_mps · tip_radius_m · detect_latency_s · result_frame_id · base_to_fixture · support_z_m · search_origin_pose · result_dir · allow_concurrent&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D3DCF5;strokeColor=#22357F;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=12;fontColor=#12294D;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="200" y="1080" width="880" height="320" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="GE" value="&lt;b&gt;geometry_estimator&lt;/b&gt; (계산 모듈 · 노드 아님)&lt;br/&gt;편향 보정 √(2rδ−δ²)+v·지연 · 윗면 사각형 · 외곽 엣지·경로 후보 4 · 지지면 투영 8꼭짓점·12모서리" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#5566B5;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#22357F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="230" y="1300" width="400" height="80" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="RS" value="&lt;b&gt;result_store&lt;/b&gt; (로컬 보관 모듈 · 노드 아님)&lt;br/&gt;측정값 · 설정 스냅샷 · 단계/방향/중단 위치 · 이벤트 로그 (JSON/CSV) · 재시작 원본 · 웹 DB와 구분" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#5566B5;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#22357F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="660" y="1300" width="400" height="80" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="SAF" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;safety_monitor&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;소프트웨어 이상 감시(과대 외력 30 N(2차) · &lt;b&gt;모서리 하강량 제한(2차 · 기준 = operation이 SLIDE로 바뀐 첫 샘플의 z)&lt;/b&gt; · 속도 · 하강/작업영역 · 샘플 stale · 로봇 연결 · 웹 HB 만료) → /robot/stop 즉시 로컬 요청(웹 경유 없음) · 안전 상태 발행(motion_id · 위치 · stop_confirmed) · 래치 · 해제는 /safety/reset으로만 · 하드웨어 안전 대체 아님&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#4A5668&quot;&gt;param: over_force_n · drop_limit_m · max_speed_mps · workspace_min_m · workspace_max_m · max_descend_m · sample_stale_ms · robot_status_timeout_ms · hb_timeout_s · hb_expired_action · latch_levels&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D3DCF5;strokeColor=#22357F;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=12;fontColor=#12294D;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1500" y="1080" width="700" height="160" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CD" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;contact_detector&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;접촉(CONTACT) · 접촉 소실(EDGE) · 과대 외력(OVER_FORCE) 판정 · &lt;b&gt;판정 모드 = 샘플의 operation (DESCEND→CONTACT · SLIDE→EDGE · 그 외 판정 안 함 · OVER_FORCE는 항상 원시 외력)&lt;/b&gt; · 이벤트의 motion_id는 판정 샘플에서 복사 · tare(기준값 F₀) · 필터 · 디바운스(연속 3회) · 입력원 robot_force | sim (A. RG2 폭 변화 제외)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#4A5668&quot;&gt;param: source · contact_threshold_n · edge_drop_m · edge_force_drop_ratio · debounce_n · over_force_n · tare_duration_s · tare_max_force_n · filter_window · stale_age_ms · sim_box_size_m · sim_box_origin_m&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D3DCF5;strokeColor=#22357F;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=12;fontColor=#12294D;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="200" y="1750" width="750" height="220" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="RM" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;robot_manager&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;모션 · 힘/순응 제어 · 상태 수집 · 제공 드라이버 호출 단일 창구 · 단위(mm·deg↔m·rad)/프레임 변환 · RG2 탐침 파지 명령 · sample_id 발급 · &lt;b&gt;샘플·상태에 실행 중 goal의 motion_id · operation 기록&lt;/b&gt; · 모서리 하강량 제한 1차(DROP_LIMIT · 기준 z는 2차와 같음) · compliance_active / force_ctrl_active 보고 · 정지/취소/OVER_FORCE 우선 · 순응·힘 제어 해제 finally 보장&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#4A5668&quot;&gt;param: slide_target_force_n · drop_limit_m · sample_rate_hz · status_rate_hz · home_pose · frame_id · dsr_namespace · dsr_model · mode · rg2_grip_width_m · rg2_grip_force_n · stop_timeout_s&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D3DCF5;strokeColor=#22357F;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=12;fontColor=#12294D;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1350" y="1750" width="850" height="220" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="DSR" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;[외부] 두산 드라이버 doosan-robot2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;dsr_bringup2 · dsr_hardware2 · dsr_msgs2 · 실행명 dsr_controller2 · 네임스페이스 dsr01 · 모델 m0609 · mode:=virtual 힘 제어 미동작 가능 [E10] · 실제 이름/타입 [E19] 실PC 확인" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E9EDF1;strokeColor=#8A96A3;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#333F4E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1350" y="2120" width="500" height="140" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="RG2D" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;[외부] OnRobot RG2 드라이버&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;onrobot_driver · 소스 근거 [E18] · 실제 노드/네임스페이스 [E19] 확인" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E9EDF1;strokeColor=#8A96A3;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#333F4E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1950" y="2120" width="250" height="140" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CTRL" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;[외부] M0609 컨트롤러 (DRCF · DART 2.12.1) + RG2 + 무센서 탐침 팁 · 배치 가이드/스토퍼&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;제공 드라이버 너머 · 관절 토크 → 외력 추정 · 안전 기능(TP E-Stop · STO · 충돌 감지 · 협동 속도)은 여기가 담당 · 소프트웨어는 이 설정을 바꾸지 않음 (BRD 4.5 ※)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E9EDF1;strokeColor=#8A96A3;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#333F4E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1350" y="2470" width="850" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
